    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.poster.avif?t=1755300716\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.webm?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.mp4?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What is Necrosis: Dawn of Dread?</u></strong> <br><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is a tense, first-person co-op survival horror experience that blends the claustrophobic dread of old-school horror games with modern gameplay mechanics. Team up with up to three friends to scavenge supplies, survive brutal encounters, and solve deadly puzzles in a city overwhelmed by the undead. Every match is a desperate fight to survive\u2014with no second chances.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/3cf3cbea291f58315eb346f3114d44af.poster.avif?t=1755300716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/3cf3cbea291f58315eb346f3114d44af.webm?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/3cf3cbea291f58315eb346f3114d44af.mp4?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic survival horror from a new angle. NDOD drops you into large, unpredictable environments filled with relentless enemies, dwindling resources, and no guarantees. The only way out\u2026 is together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited ammo, choose your shots carefully, and master a variety of weapons. NDOD rewards precision and teamwork\u2014reckless shooting will only get you killed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered, interactive puzzles that challenge your observation and deduction skills. These are designed to keep you thinking and actively involved in every mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twelve Unique Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your squad from a roster of twelve distinct survivors, each with a unique role and special ability\u2014healing, melee takedowns, enemy debuffs, starting gear, and more. Mix and match characters to find the ideal team synergy.<br>Discover and unlock additional <strong>secret characters</strong> as you progress, each bringing new tactics and surprises to your survival toolkit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Replayable Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <i>fifteen</i> large environments inspired by survival horror classics. From hospitals to city streets, every location is filled with atmosphere, threats, and secrets to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two sessions are the same. Enemy placements, item locations, and some puzzles change each time you play. The experience stays fresh no matter how often you return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Session-based design means you can drop in for a quick run or settle in for a night of survival. Perfect for both casual and hardcore co-op players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatcher Queue</strong> \u2013 Match with other survivors and use proximity VOIP or text chat to coordinate your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Mode</strong> \u2013 Play solo if you prefer, but NDOD is best experienced in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No microtransactions. Unlock cosmetics and rewards through gameplay, not payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for the fastest clears and prove your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-Term Roadmap</strong> \u2013 Additional levels, characters, and enemies planned post-launch\u2014all free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No DRM. No Third-Party Accounts.</strong> \u2013 Just buy the game and play. No logins, no restrictions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game That Respects You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is developed by a small, independent team with no corporate backing and no interest in exploitative practices. No microtransactions. No always-online requirement. No nonsense. Just pure survival horror\u2014built for players who love the genre.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.poster.avif?t=1755300716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.webm?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.mp4?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.poster.avif?t=1755300716\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.webm?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/6c288565032d4e5651c881f1ea96ae59.mp4?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What is Necrosis: Dawn of Dread?</u></strong> <br><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is a tense, first-person co-op survival horror experience that blends the claustrophobic dread of old-school horror games with modern gameplay mechanics. Team up with up to three friends to scavenge supplies, survive brutal encounters, and solve deadly puzzles in a city overwhelmed by the undead. Every match is a desperate fight to survive\u2014with no second chances.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/3cf3cbea291f58315eb346f3114d44af.poster.avif?t=1755300716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/3cf3cbea291f58315eb346f3114d44af.webm?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/3cf3cbea291f58315eb346f3114d44af.mp4?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic survival horror from a 