rong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatcher Queue</strong> \u2013 Match with other survivors and use proximity VOIP or text chat to coordinate your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Mode</strong> \u2013 Play solo if you prefer, but NDOD is best experienced in co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No microtransactions. Unlock cosmetics and rewards through gameplay, not payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for the fastest clears and prove your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-Term Roadmap</strong> \u2013 Additional levels, characters, and enemies planned post-launch\u2014all free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No DRM. No Third-Party Accounts.</strong> \u2013 Just buy the game and play. No logins, no restrictions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game That Respects You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread</i> is developed by a small, independent team with no corporate backing and no interest in exploitative practices. No microtransactions. No always-online requirement. No nonsense. Just pure survival horror\u2014built for players who love the genre.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.poster.avif?t=1755300716\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.webm?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/85876790fcb6b0e577db4e02ea971361.mp4?t=1755300716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
